@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@access_token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE

### Get current user - success
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get current user - missing token -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Get current user - malformed token -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-jwt
